# vim:ft=conf
# isyncrc Gmail template for mbsync
# Copy to ~/.config/isyncrc and edit

## Gmail Account
IMAPAccount account-gmail
Host imap.gmail.com
Port 993
User your-email@gmail.com
PassCmd "/usr/share/neomutt/oauth2/mutt_oauth2.py --decryption-pipe 'gpg --decrypt --pinentry-mode loopback' ~/.cache/mutt/oauth-gmail"
TLSType None
AuthMechs XOAUTH2
Tunnel "openssl s_client -quiet -ign_eof -connect imap.gmail.com:993 -servername imap.gmail.com -proxy 127.0.0.1:7890"

IMAPStore account-gmail-remote
Account account-gmail

MaildirStore account-gmail-local
Path ~/doc/mail/account-gmail/
Inbox ~/doc/mail/account-gmail/INBOX
SubFolders Verbatim

Channel account-gmail
Far :account-gmail-remote:
Near :account-gmail-local:
Patterns *
Expunge both
CopyArrivalDate yes
Sync All
Create Near
SyncState *
